abstract: >-
  Code, per-item predictions, raw LLM responses, analysis outputs, and SHA256 provenance for
  measuring item-level cross-lingual consistency of multilingual natural language inference on
  the parallel XNLI test set. Code is MIT-licensed; experimental outputs and documentation are
  CC BY 4.0 with third-party exceptions (see LICENSE-OUTPUTS.md).
